\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0   Through our holy baptism they made
\par \pard\li270\sl202\slmult0 us into our Jesus Christ death:
\par That we will stay on earth, not in sin
\par Satan and earthly things abide
\par This baptism has made us like
\par The kindred of the Lord of hosts.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  By this baptism they buried us
\par \pard\li270\sl202\slmult0 with our Lord and of Christ Jesus;
\par And as the Lord our God and Father
\par raised him from death with His glory
\par and when he up from the dead
\par Eternal life we also have.
\par \pard\li270\sl40\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li405\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3.  It then behoves on all of us that
\par \pard\li405\sl180\slmult0 We take a new life for our path?
\par We throw away all the earthly life,
\par And all the sins we've committed
\par It behoves us to live again
\par  just as our Master also lives.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li405\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   4.  If we will die with him for our sins
\par \pard\li405\sl180\slmult0 And we will follow him always,
\par We shall by our Holy baptism
\par Mixed up with the heav'ns and angels
\par And we shall have His Glory now
\par And everlasting life and peace.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

